# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# System account the compile worker runs as. Applied by systemd-sysusers from
# the package's post-install scriptlet.
#
# Deliberately NOT the pace-kv account. A worker runs a compiler on input
# that arrived over the network, while pace-kv owns the cache storage -- and
# the trust model says a worker is given no cache credentials at all. Sharing
# one account would undo that at the filesystem level: a compromised compile
# would be running as the identity that can rewrite every cached object.
#
# Type User                  ID  GECOS                    Home directory  Shell
u      fastcache-node        -   "fastcache compile node" /               -
